    <programme start="20260705160000 +0800" stop="20260705170000 +0800" channel="311">
      <title>Fatal Engineering 第1季第1集 -Plane Crashes</title>
      <desc>Aviation is one of the safest forms of travel—until something goes terribly wrong. This episode of Fatal Engineering dives deep into the stories behind some of the most devastating plane crashes in modern history. Through expert analysis, recreations, and insider accounts, we uncover how small design flaws, rushed procedures, and ignored warnings contributed to catastrophic failures. Discover what really brought these aircraft down—and how those tragedies led to life-saving innovations.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260705170000 +0800" stop="20260705173000 +0800" channel="311">
      <title>Jet Truck 第1季第3集 -You Call That an Explosion?</title>
      <desc>Chris and Wayner forgo family time between performances to join local racer and wild man, Billy for an afternoon of shooting guns and blowing stuff up, while Brooke&amp;apos;s mounting frustration doesn’t fare well for their return.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260705173000 +0800" stop="20260705180000 +0800" channel="311">
      <title>Jet Truck 第1季第4集 -Hot Rods and Speed Boats</title>
      <desc>The King Of The North drag race kicks off with Billy scrambling to prepare his hotrod for its race against Chris and the Jet Truck, in a challenge that will see the loser facing public humiliation.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260705180000 +0800" stop="20260705190000 +0800" channel="311">
      <title>Trucking Hell 第2季第5集 -Highlight 5</title>
      <desc>In this episode a 40-ton lorry rammed full of scrap metal overturns and spills its steel load across a major A road during rush hour, and Lantern recovery op Steve Knight is called to the scene. 25 tonnes of metal must be removed from the lorry before it can be lifted and with a damaged 5th wheel, it’s a job that will push Steve and his team to the limit. At Crouch HQ there’s excitement in the air as the team give trucking superfan Chris and his disabled daughter, the ride of his life by taking him to his wedding in a big orange truck. Late at night, recovery op Snod is called to the side of the M69 to recover two crashed cars. With one on its side with the hand brake off, he must take care righting it to make sure it doesn’t roll into the passing traffic. It’s particularly tough job for Snod as his friend was killed on the same stretch of road whilst recovering a vehicle.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260705190000 +0800" stop="20260705200000 +0800" channel="311">
      <title>Trucking Hell 第2季第6集 -Highlight 6</title>
      <desc>This week a heavy rescue like no other – as father and son Dave and Adam Crouch team up to save a lorry transporting a train from sinking into soft ground. Crouch Recovery Op Jim must rescue a lorry from a ditch after the driver attempted an ill-advised three-point turn. And while Rory moves an antique fire engine for the boss, Fluff must get rid of a lorry load of stinking cheese…</desc>
    </programme>
