    </programme>
    <programme start="20260705024500 +0800" stop="20260705031100 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Version Francaise 第11季第12集 -Maison Des Canuts/Sarah Valente/Thibaut Thierry</title>
      <desc>The Maison des Canuts traces the long tradition of Lyon&amp;apos;s gold, silver and silk weavers. Each creation by visual artist Sarah Valente sounds like a call from the forest. Zomer is turning fashion upside down. In Brittany, craftsman Thibaut Thierry works paper with seaweed.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260705031100 +0800" stop="20260705033500 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Partis Skier 第1季第10集 -Connecting With The Land</title>
      <desc>To view skiing as a way to better connect with the land, Alexis and Thomas head to the Groulx Mountains in northern Quebec for a cross-country ski outing.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260705033500 +0800" stop="20260705034900 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Demo De Mode 第1季第2集 -Stephane Rolland</title>
      <desc>His runway shows are steeped in feelings and emotion. Stephane Rolland has chosen bliss as the theme for his new spring-summer 2024 haute couture collection, which also pays tribute to the East.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260705034900 +0800" stop="20260705040300 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Demo De Mode 第1季第3集 -Patou</title>
      <desc>With a predilection for bringing life back to dormant fashion houses, and an unfailing love of elegance: Guillaume Henry presents his autumn-winter 2024/2025 collection for Patou.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260705040300 +0800" stop="20260705042900 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Le Gout Des Rencontres Normandes 第1集 -Gin Gravlax Salmon</title>
      <desc>In Franqueville-Saint-Pierre, Seine-Maritime, Julien and Elodie distill their own gin. David Gallienne visits them and prepares one of his favorite recipes: gin gravlax salmon.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260705042900 +0800" stop="20260705045500 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Chroniques Mediterraneennes Nature 第2集 -The Upper Verdon</title>
      <desc>The Verdon is known for its vertiginous cliffs, its rushing river and its turquoise artificial lakes. But there is another side to it, upstream from the gorges, a Verdon of wild lavender, preserved forests and flocks of sheep, where the landscapes are no less magnificent.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260705045500 +0800" stop="20260705053600 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Les Chefs ! 第14季第8集</title>
      <desc>For this 100% vegetarian challenge, the brigade must prepare a starter and a dessert, showcasing vegetables.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260705053600 +0800" stop="20260705070700 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Echappees Belles 第19季第21集 -A Winter In The Pyrenees</title>
      <desc>From the green of the Pyrenees to the blue of the Mediterranean, the Pyrenees-Orientales offer an impressive diversity of landscapes. This contrast makes the department an ideal holiday destination, where you can enjoy winter sports in the morning and the sun in the afternoon, while discovering Catalan culture, its gastronomy and its architecture. Jerome Pitorin begins his journey in the resort of Les Angles with Cecile Hernandez, Paralympic snowboarding champion.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260705070700 +0800" stop="20260705073100 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Curieux Begin 第9集 -Onions</title>
      <desc>Comedian Matthieu Pepper, teacher Pierre-Antoine Gilbert, actress Benedicte Decary, and chef Mathieu Cloutier highlight onions in creative recipes, enhanced by wines selected by Michelle Bouffard.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260705073100 +0800" stop="20260705082200 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Silence, CA Pousse ! 第17集 -La Balaiterie/Green Waste/La Garenne Lemot</title>
      <desc>On the programme: Marie-Laure and Arnaud Gabriel, makers of handmade sorgo brooms; green waste; the gardens of the Domaine de la Garenne Lemot, Italy revisited; Don&amp;apos;t panic with Sophie and Olivier.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260705082200 +0800" stop="20260705084600 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Une Brique Dans Le Ventre 第30集 -Renovation Of A 1970S House In Namur</title>
      <desc>Discovery in the Namur region of a renovation focused on increasing the energy efficiency of the house.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260705084600 +0800" stop="20260705091200 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Version Francaise 第11季第12集 -Maison Des Canuts/Sarah Valente/Thibaut Thierry</title>
      <desc>The Maison des Canuts traces the long tradition of Lyon&amp;apos;s gold, silver and silk weavers. Each creation by visual artist Sarah Valente sounds like a call from the forest. Zomer is turning fashion upside down. In Brittany, craftsman Thibaut Thierry works paper with seaweed.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260705091200 +0800" stop="20260705093600 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Partis Skier 第1季第10集 -Connecting With The Land</title>
      <desc>To view skiing as a way to better connect with the land, Alexis and Thomas head to the Groulx Mountains in northern Quebec for a cross-country ski outing.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260705093600 +0800" stop="20260705095000 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Demo De Mode 第1季第2集 -Stephane Rolland</title>
      <desc>His runway shows are steeped in feelings and emotion. Stephane Rolland has chosen bliss as the theme for his new spring-summer 2024 haute couture collection, which also pays tribute to the East.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260705095000 +0800" stop="20260705100400 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Demo De Mode 第1季第3集 -Patou</title>
      <desc>With a predilection for bringing life back to dormant fashion houses, and an unfailing love of elegance: Guillaume Henry presents his autumn-winter 2024/2025 collection for Patou.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260705100400 +0800" stop="20260705103100 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Passe-Moi Les Jumelles 第14季第5集 -Eyes In The Skies</title>
      <desc>An amateur astronomer, Michel Ory has a passion: hunting asteroids and comets. He is the only living Swiss citizen to have discovered two comets, and is credited with the discovery of hundreds of asteroids. A luminous quest that takes us from Switzerland to Morocco.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260705103100 +0800" stop="20260705110100 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Cuisine Ouverte 第17集 -In Annecy, With Just Riadh</title>
      <desc>Mory Sacko is in Annecy with influencer Just Riadh. On today&amp;apos;s menu: Savoyard gratin.</desc>
