      <title>Vroum 第6集 -Gts In Pays De Caux</title>
      <desc>In Mont-Cauvaire, Laurent and Oceane meet lovers of grand touring cars. The Peugeot 104 celebrates its 50th anniversary. Michel discovers the Swedish brand Saab.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260706004900 +0800" stop="20260706011400 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Les Saisons De Pique-Assiette 第15季第5集 -Provencal Daube</title>
      <desc>Annick Jeanmairet and Brigitte Rosset offer you a recipe for Provencal daube. Discovery of the day: white wine tart.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260706011400 +0800" stop="20260706031000 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Des Racines &amp;amp; Des Ailes 第2集 -The Coastal Enthusiasts: From The Arcachon Basin To The North Of Brittany</title>
      <desc>Along the Atlantic coast to the English Channel stretches a rich but fragile coastline. From the Vendee marshes to the Arcachon basin, passing through the bay of Saint-Malo and the fort of Fouras in Charente-Maritime, local actors are intensely involved in preserving nature and heritage.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260706031000 +0800" stop="20260706033400 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>C&amp;apos;est Du Belge 第9集 -Belgian Chic</title>
      <desc>First stop at the Zoute Grand Prix, where the cars shine brighter than the sun. Collectors bring out their exceptional cars to make them purr along the seafront. A change of altitude and a stopover in Les Gets, with Michelin-starred chef Christophe Pauly. Finally, Paris, Fashion Week and Facon Jacmin.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260706033400 +0800" stop="20260706040000 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>CA Pousse Au Fenua 第2季第2集 -Towards Food Self-Sufficiency In The Islands</title>
      <desc>French Polynesia depends on food imports even though the territory is rich in natural resources. Through family initiatives, from a guesthouse to a large restaurant, an exploration of the return to the &amp;apos;&amp;apos;faapu&amp;apos;&amp;apos; and &amp;apos;&amp;apos;eating local&amp;apos;&amp;apos;, highlighting the natural resources of the territories.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260706040000 +0800" stop="20260706040500 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Vf 第9季第1集 -The Custodia Foundation</title>
      <desc>Fashion, design, gastronomy, lifestyle... Discover the world of French chic!</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260706040500 +0800" stop="20260706043200 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Passe-Moi Les Jumelles 第14季第5集 -Eyes In The Skies</title>
      <desc>An amateur astronomer, Michel Ory has a passion: hunting asteroids and comets. He is the only living Swiss citizen to have discovered two comets, and is credited with the discovery of hundreds of asteroids. A luminous quest that takes us from Switzerland to Morocco.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260706043200 +0800" stop="20260706050300 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Cuisine Ouverte 第17集 -In Annecy, With Just Riadh</title>
      <desc>Mory Sacko is in Annecy with influencer Just Riadh. On today&amp;apos;s menu: Savoyard gratin.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260706050300 +0800" stop="20260706053000 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Tendance XXI 第11季第11集 -German-Pratin Style/Hotel Victoria Nice</title>
      <desc>Decorators and gallery owners meet in Saint-Germain-des-Pres to shake up the German-Pratin style. Find out all about the origins of the Tarte Tropezienne. The great tradition of Nice resorts opens a new chapter in its history with the Hotel Victoria. Faux fur is now an integral part of the leather goods at some of the world&amp;apos;s leading fashion houses.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260706053000 +0800" stop="20260706055600 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Le Beau Velo De Ravel 第8集 -Liege Sart Tilman</title>
      <desc>A finale towards the &amp;apos;&amp;apos;fiery city&amp;apos;&amp;apos;! At its highest point is the University of Liege - Sart Tilman campus, surrounded by nature. The site includes an open-air museum, the Streupas heath, Colonster Castle and the Robert Louis-Dreyfus Football Academy.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260706055600 +0800" stop="20260706062300 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Paname 第10集 -Collectors</title>
      <desc>Collectors&amp;apos; passion grows over the years, sometimes turning into obsession. In these very closed circles, members know each other and interact. Most are discreet, often reluctant to reveal their treasures. Others agree to share them...</desc>
    </programme>
