      <title>Les Ambassadeurs 第18集 -Vielsalm</title>
      <desc>Discover Vielsalm, a natural gem where authenticity reveals itself as soon as you arrive at the station, ideally located in the center of town. Stops include the forest, the Coticule Museum, and Center Parcs Les Ardennes.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260706103000 +0800" stop="20260706110000 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Les Ambassadeurs 第19集 -Malmedy</title>
      <desc>Located at the foot of the Hautes Fagnes nature reserve, Malmedy attracts nature lovers in every season, with rivers, forests and landscapes perfect for hiking. Nathalie explores the Tros Maret trail, the Warche quarries, and the Malmundarium.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260706110000 +0800" stop="20260706112800 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Generation F 第1季第4集 -Chanoir (Paris)/Hakim Idriss (Paris, Dubai, The Comoros)</title>
      <desc>In the Parisian district of the Canal Saint-Martin, Richard Orlinski meets Alberto Vejarano, known as Chanoir, a Franco-Colombian graffiti artist whose works blend pop art and free figuration, embodied by his iconic cat. Together, they restore a legal wall, revealing the techniques and passion that drive this pioneer of street art. Hakim Idriss, known as Socrome, is a Parisian graffiti artist of Comorian origin. Accompanied by Babs, a multidisciplinary artist, they create a large mural. Hakim explains how he nurtures the Comorian street art scene by sharing his knowledge and developing collective projects. In Dubai, he exhibits work that blends graffiti, abstraction and palette knife painting, a technique adopted to explore new forms of expression.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260706112800 +0800" stop="20260706115500 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Le Gout Des Rencontres En Nouvelle-Aquitaine 第63集 -Carbonara In The Basque Style In Itxassou</title>
      <desc>Alessandra Montagne meets Christian in Itxassou. He raises a breed of pigs that nearly disappeared: the Basque Kintoa pig. Together, they prepare a revisited carbonara pasta recipe in the Basque style.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260706115500 +0800" stop="20260706122100 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Littoral 第17集 -Brest Dockworkers</title>
      <desc>They are invisible but essential: the dockworkers moor and undock all the merchant ships that enter and leave the ports. Sailors on land, they live on the watch, just like on a ship. In an increasingly automated world, they are an essential link in global maritime trade.</desc>
    </programme>
    <programme start="20260706122100 +0800" stop="20260706131900 +0800" channel="245">
      <title>Meteo A La Carte 第142集</title>
      <desc>An interactive programme that&amp;apos;s as fun as it is informative and reactive to the meteorological events of the moment. Reports from the regions and special subjects in the studio offer an easy way to better understand the impact weather has on health, nature, history and everyday life.</desc>
    </programme>
